  "cards": [
    {
      "id": "cdj-qs-d4f788c1c1",
      "lang": "fr",
      "text": "Je vais te guider pas à pas. Tu n’as rien à faire d’autre que ressentir ce qui se passe en toi pendant que je parle.",
      "trackId": "51d7f27c-2ed1-4de0-821a-83e21384ffd6",
      "title": "Commencer",
      "startSec": 15,
      "audio_url": "assets/audio/51d7f27c-2ed1-4de0-821a-83e21384ffd6.mp3",
      "audio_url_aac": "assets/audio/51d7f27c-2ed1-4de0-821a-83e21384ffd6.m4a",
      "cover_url": "assets/covers/51d7f27c-2ed1-4de0-821a-83e21384ffd6.jpeg",
      "suno_share": "https://suno.com/s/8y2J6ymed3JaMCrI"
    },
    {
      "id": "cdj-qs-5742516002",
      "lang": "fr",
      "text": "L’ Être éternel n’a jamais commencé. Il est là depuis toujours, sans début ni fin.",
      "trackId": "f95b9e6c-bc0b-4d6f-b2b6-8089d498c6ef",
      "title": "Et que ce soit",
      "startSec": 15,
      "audio_url": "assets/audio/f95b9e6c-bc0b-4d6f-b2b6-8089d498c6ef.mp3",
      "audio_url_aac": "assets/audio/f95b9e6c-bc0b-4d6f-b2b6-8089d498c6ef.m4a",
      "cover_url": "assets/covers/f95b9e6c-bc0b-4d6f-b2b6-8089d498c6ef.jpeg",
      "suno_share": "https://suno.com/s/8mOJxJUOEu653pl7"
    },
    {
      "id": "cdj-qs-8200e22c63",
      "lang": "fr",
      "text": "Écoute la différence entre la cage et le souffle... La sensation c'est être dans la structure.",
      "trackId": "f5bf8830-85bb-4a9b-9545-081800be485f",
      "title": "La Sensibilité est la Fonction",
      "startSec": 15,
      "audio_url": "assets/audio/f5bf8830-85bb-4a9b-9545-081800be485f.mp3",
      "audio_url_aac": "assets/audio/f5bf8830-85bb-4a9b-9545-081800be485f.m4a",
      "cover_url": "assets/covers/f5bf8830-85bb-4a9b-9545-081800be485f.jpeg",
      "suno_share": "https://suno.com/s/zcIyAJuM0oB4E6sm"
    },
    {
      "id": "cdj-qs-4579830fb2",
      "lang": "fr",
      "text": "Des yeux qui brillent sans forcer, des nez qui disent « j’suis bien là »,",
      "trackId": "d34adae3-fd22-4ac7-80c3-6978b0457546",
      "title": "La beauté vénère",
      "startSec": 15,
      "cover_url": "assets/covers/d34adae3-fd22-4ac7-80c3-6978b0457546.jpeg",
      "embed_url": "https://suno.com/embed/d34adae3-fd22-4ac7-80c3-6978b0457546",
      "suno_share": "https://suno.com/s/83avz9w9OOu5gdm8"
    },
    {
      "id": "cdj-qs-4df6d36f5f",
      "lang": "fr",
      "text": "C’est ce qui donne envie de jouer, ce qui rend le jeu beau et vivant. Alors comment on joue vraiment ?",
      "trackId": "f40bcbea-d8a7-448c-9e3b-fe6f7556f176",
      "title": "Le Grand Jeu",
      "startSec": 15,
      "cover_url": "assets/covers/f40bcbea-d8a7-448c-9e3b-fe6f7556f176.jpeg",
      "embed_url": "https://suno.com/embed/f40bcbea-d8a7-448c-9e3b-fe6f7556f176",
      "suno_share": "https://suno.com/s/RY1I6gIBLXtKfTFg"
    },
    {
      "id": "cdj-qs-2af773cbef",
      "lang": "fr",
      "text": "Un Soleil qui brille, c’est le 1, le flux qui crée Les trous noirs, c’est le 0, le vide qui attend",
      "trackId": "b51d4773-9849-4bb8-9def-06b99c2a8dc2",
      "title": "Optim Us Le Double Cœur",
      "startSec": 15,
      "cover_url": "assets/covers/b51d4773-9849-4bb8-9def-06b99c2a8dc2.jpeg",
      "embed_url": "https://suno.com/embed/b51d4773-9849-4bb8-9def-06b99c2a8dc2",
      "suno_share": "https://suno.com/s/vflQVfGjSsR3ygh2"
    },
    {
      "id": "cdj-qs-f4a6dcffc4",
      "lang": "fr",
      "text": "La fonction première de la vie, c’est :être présent et reconnaître la présence de l’autre. À tout point de vue, de mieux en mieux, plus dense et en danse.",
      "trackId": "6f66fa1b-ee30-428e-823d-d62524debf08",
      "title": "Présence en Chœur",
      "startSec": 15,
      "cover_url": "assets/covers/6f66fa1b-ee30-428e-823d-d62524debf08.jpeg",
      "embed_url": "https://suno.com/embed/6f66fa1b-ee30-428e-823d-d62524debf08",
      "suno_share": "https://suno.com/s/2RFvoN6cNplPCI3j"
    },
    {
      "id": "cdj-qs-cde8bec4bb",
      "lang": "fr",
      "text": "Où l'amour devenait une attente mécanique. Il voyagea de monde en monde, chez les grandes personnes,",
      "trackId": "8e360ed6-fb4a-43fa-962f-55020c20ce05",
      "title": "Regarde avec le cœur",
      "startSec": 15,
      "cover_url": "assets/covers/8e360ed6-fb4a-43fa-962f-55020c20ce05.jpeg",
      "embed_url": "https://suno.com/embed/8e360ed6-fb4a-43fa-962f-55020c20ce05",
      "suno_share": "https://suno.com/s/VUSCZBLQL9zfEEhm"
    },
    {
      "id": "cdj-qs-f3bf669140",
      "lang": "fr",
      "text": "Je plonge mes mains dans la terre froide, je ressens le futur qui naît Je lève les yeux vers le ciel, je sens un nouveau monde qui se déploie",
      "trackId": "2c8a36c9-4207-41b9-80e9-bf78313c2099",
      "title": "Tout ce que je demande l'univers me le donne",
      "startSec": 15,
      "audio_url": "assets/audio/2c8a36c9-4207-41b9-80e9-bf78313c2099.mp3",
      "audio_url_aac": "assets/audio/2c8a36c9-4207-41b9-80e9-bf78313c2099.m4a",
      "cover_url": "assets/covers/2c8a36c9-4207-41b9-80e9-bf78313c2099.jpeg",
      "suno_share": "https://suno.com/s/xEWZPaMo5HSbXeMp"
    },
    {
      "id": "cdj-qs-04bad7128d",
      "lang": "fr",
      "text": "Pas la peau, pas les os – le geste. Le \"tiens, j'touche, j'ajuste, j'fais mieux\".",
      "trackId": "c8c1762f-a285-45c2-909d-77fbd4ddd395",
      "title": "Ç'a main",
      "startSec": 15,
      "cover_url": "assets/covers/c8c1762f-a285-45c2-909d-77fbd4ddd395.jpeg",
      "embed_url": "https://suno.com/embed/c8c1762f-a285-45c2-909d-77fbd4ddd395",
      "suno_share": "https://suno.com/s/f2AwwHy0GMHk2PgV"
    },
    {
      "id": "cdj-qs-1d57099549",
      "lang": "fr",
      "text": "Chaque instant est un fil. Nous sommes les tisserands conscients.",
      "trackId": "702aaf9e-cde4-4b51-900c-a790db4a2320",
      "title": "Éternel sur Terre",
      "startSec": 15,
      "audio_url": "assets/audio/702aaf9e-cde4-4b51-900c-a790db4a2320.mp3",
      "audio_url_aac": "assets/audio/702aaf9e-cde4-4b51-900c-a790db4a2320.m4a",
      "cover_url": "assets/covers/702aaf9e-cde4-4b51-900c-a790db4a2320.jpeg",
      "suno_share": "https://suno.com/s/oRnEqpE4a1BAGDPM"
    },
    {
      "id": "cdj-ql-39b0a7e0e8",
      "lang": "fr",
      "text": "Les trois mouvements véritables. Je vais te guider pas à pas.",
